### 1. Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes

### 2. Get dish by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/1

### 3. Get missing dish (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/999

### 4. Filter dishes by restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1

### 5. Create a dish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Special Kitfo",
  "priceSantim": 25000,
  "restaurantId": 1
}